    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/fb018a1a41defc5303e693d8601c4f98.poster.avif?t=1737732986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/fb018a1a41defc5303e693d8601c4f98.webm?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/fb018a1a41defc5303e693d8601c4f98.mp4?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>After the reporter Iris Dormer reconnects with her estranged brother, she finds herself in Phoenix Springs, a desert oasis home to an enigmatic community. As she explores ancient ruins and interrogates a rich cast of characters, she must uncover the mysteries that connect the place, the myths, and herself.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/195530c6dce8456c817a41f296d3bb79.poster.avif?t=1737732986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/195530c6dce8456c817a41f296d3bb79.webm?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/195530c6dce8456c817a41f296d3bb79.mp4?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Inspired by classic <strong>point-and-click games</strong>, Phoenix Springs updates the genre for the modern player with intuitive controls\u00a0and a\u00a0streamlined UI.<br><br>Conduct your investigation by collecting clues and leads in your inventory rather than physical objects. Connect these clues with the environment or mention them in conversations to progress. Discard false leads and red herrings as you solve\u00a0logical puzzles designed to challenge and delight fans of\u00a0story-rich\u00a0interactive experiences.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/362d21b6b454e2670c243b23c7f2f130.poster.avif?t=1737732986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/362d21b6b454e2670c243b23c7f2f130.webm?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/362d21b6b454e2670c243b23c7f2f130.mp4?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully voice-acted<br></li><li>Hand-drawn art and animations<br></li><li>Streamlined UI<br></li><li>Immersive neo-noir universe<br></li><li>Challenging puzzles</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/fb018a1a41defc5303e693d8601c4f98.poster.avif?t=1737732986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/fb018a1a41defc5303e693d8601c4f98.webm?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/fb018a1a41defc5303e693d8601c4f98.mp4?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>After the reporter Iris Dormer reconnects with her estranged brother, she finds herself in Phoenix Springs, a desert oasis home to an enigmatic community. As she explores ancient ruins and interrogates a rich cast of characters, she must uncover the mysteries that connect the place, the myths, and herself.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/195530c6dce8456c817a41f296d3bb79.poster.avif?t=1737732986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/195530c6dce8456c817a41f296d3bb79.webm?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/195530c6dce8456c817a41f296d3bb79.mp4?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Inspired by classic <strong>point-and-click games</strong>, Phoenix Springs updates the genre for the modern player with intuitive controls\u00a0and a\u00a0streamlined UI.<br><br>Conduct your investigation by collecting clues and leads in your inventory rather than physical objects. Connect these clues with the environment or mention them in conversations to progress. Discard false leads and red herrings as you solve\u00a0logical puzzles designed to challenge and delight fans of\u00a0story-rich\u00a0interactive experiences.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/362d21b6b454e2670c243b23c7f2f130.poster.avif?t=1737732986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/362d21b6b454e2670c243b23c7f2f130.webm?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973310/extras/362d21b6b454e2670c243b23c7f2f130.mp4?t=1737732986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully voice-acted<br></li><li>Hand-drawn art and animations<br></li><li>Streamlined UI<br></li><li>Immersive neo-noir universe<br></li><li>Challenging puzzles</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Lose yourself in the mystery of Phoenix Springs \u2013 a modern point-and-click set in a cryptic neo-noir world. It begins with an investigation: find your brother Leo. You already know where it ends.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI\u2019ve played point-and-click adventures, sci-fi mysteries and narrative games, but I\u2019ve never seen one that sounds this luscious, looks this dramatic or plays this hypnotically...\u201d<br>Engadget<br><br>\u201cmuch like David Lynch\u2019s Mulholland Drive, nothing is spelt out here, and the appeal comes from pondering what it all means.\u201d<br>The Guardian<br><br>\u201c...a slippery exploration of memory, time and space grounded in Iris\u2019s quest to uncover the mystery of what happened to her brother...\u201d<br>The New York Times<br>",
